	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Grasping upon the air itself, you imbue a gust of wind with psychic energy. You are able to see and hear the world within 30 feet of the floating thought, but you are blind and deaf to your body’s surroundings for the duration. The floating thought travels with the wind and you have no control over its movement.</p><p><strong>Surge.</strong> You can spend +1 psionic point to gain control of the floating thought’s movement, moving it up to 10 feet each turn; +2 psionic points to not be blind and deaf to your own surroundings [requires power rating IV].</p>",
